& [BoundaryFormation] separates supplied structural projection from observation authority
  + [inside] strict placement-plan decoding, exact profile and scalar gates, output-only binding consumption, exact entry-reference and component joins, closed mapping, current M2A validation, output-only wrapper, and bounded faults
  + [outside] physical paths, root joining, filesystem observation, Windows calls, handle or buffer provenance, Git execution, traversal, inventory ordering, stream completeness, receipts, admission, and every mutation-related effect
  + [derived_grade] identifies facts transformed through current pure binding authority
  + [declared_grade] identifies path, mode, ordinal, and projection syntax supplied by the caller
  + [projected_grade] identifies one structurally valid M2A form nested beside both grades
  - never: collapse projected_grade into physical or admitted

& [AtomicRequirementSet] is complete
  + [M2B-SRTP-001] require an exact profile, strict placement plan, denied unknown fields, and 262144-byte pre-decode cap
  + [M2B-SRTP-002] require nonzero caller-owned projection and entry-reference identities without assigning global, physical, or cryptographic meaning
  + [M2B-SRTP-003] consume one successful output-only WindowsSuppliedContentStableBinding as the only accepted lower-level evidence carrier
  + [M2B-SRTP-004] require exact equality between plan and binding entry-reference identities before projection
  + [M2B-SRTP-005] validate the complete candidate through current M2A descendant-path and structural authority
  + [M2B-SRTP-006] require exact equality between the validated path's final component and stable pre-read policy component
  + [M2B-SRTP-007] admit exactly regular_non_executable or regular_executable as caller-declared mode class
  + [M2B-SRTP-008] require and preserve a nonzero caller-declared observation ordinal without traversal claims
  + [M2B-SRTP-009] map every seed, digest, and placement field exactly without defaults, normalization, omission, or invention
  + [M2B-SRTP-010] preserve an exact nested TopologyFormFault only when current M2A validation rejects
  + [M2B-SRTP-011] release a private-field, Serialize-only, non-Deserialize wrapper preserving plan, binding, and topology form
  + [M2B-SRTP-012] return one closed bounded atomic fault and no partial successful value
  + [M2B-SRTP-013] deny physical, temporal, filesystem, Git, traversal, completeness, trust, admission, receipt, and mutation claims
  + [M2B-SRTP-014] preserve zero effects, zero unsafe, zero Cargo delta, and complete focused, static, evidence, global, quality, rollback, and downstream proof

& [PlacementPlanModel] is strict source data
  + [profile] is exact supported profile
  + [projection_identity] is nonzero caller u64 syntax
  + [entry_reference_identity] is nonzero caller u64 syntax
  + [relative_path] is a String validated through the current M2A form
  + [mode_class] is the existing closed TopologyModeClass enum
  + [observation_ordinal] is nonzero caller u64 syntax
  + [encoded_cap] is 262144 bytes before serde decode
  - never: include metadata, digest, binding, seed, physical handles, clocks, roots, or provenance booleans in the plan

& [PlanTruthTable] is exhaustive
  + [exact_profile_nonzero_ids_regular_mode_nonzero_ordinal] proceeds
  + [oversized_encoding] returns resource before decode
  + [malformed_unknown_omitted_wrong_type] returns bounded json
  + [unknown_profile] returns profile
  + [zero_projection_identity] returns projection_identity
  + [zero_entry_reference_identity] returns entry_reference_identity
  + [directory_mode] returns mode
  + [zero_ordinal] returns ordinal

& [BindingModel] preserves prerequisite construction
  + [accepted_type] is WindowsSuppliedContentStableBinding by value
  + [construction] remains private to the prerequisite bind function
  + [serialization] is inspection only because Deserialize is absent
  + [content] contains exact supplied-chunk digest evidence and complete stable pair
  + [consumption] prevents successful return from duplicating a second uncontrolled binding path
  - never: accept a standalone digest observation, stable pair, projection seed, asserted digest string, or serialized binding

& [JoinTruthTable] is exact
  + [entry_reference_equal] proceeds to candidate construction
  + [entry_reference_different] returns entry_reference before candidate release
  + [path_structurally_invalid] returns topology_form with exact nested M2A fault
  + [final_component_equal] proceeds to wrapper release
  + [final_component_different] returns component after structural path validation
  + [binding_kind_regular_file] is required by prerequisite construction and checked defensively in mapping
  + [unexpected_binding_kind] returns kind

& [ProjectionMappingTable] is closed
  + [relative_path] is Some exact plan relative_path
  + [kind] is exact stable pre-read topology projection seed kind
  + [mode_class] is exact accepted plan mode class
  + [attributes] is exact seed attributes
  + [identity] is exact seed StrongFileIdentity
  + [number_of_links] is exact seed count
  + [streams] is exact seed TopologyStreamFact sequence
  + [length] is exact seed length
  + [content_sha256] is Some exact binding content-observation derived_sha256
  + [observation_ordinal] is exact plan ordinal
  = must: call current ValidateTopologyForm on the completed value
  - never: infer or replace any mapped field

& [PathRelationModel] is syntax only
  + current M2A validation owns maximum bytes, root/descendant shape, separators, navigation segments, NUL, colon, and .git exclusions
  + final component is obtained by exact slash separation after structural validation
  + stable pre-read component is usable because the prerequisite stable pair proves exact pre/post policy-decision equality
  + exact component equality checks internal supplied-value coherence only
  - never: normalize Unicode, fold case, trim, canonicalize, resolve, join to root, or claim existence

& [ModeRelationModel] is declaration only
  + regular_non_executable is accepted unchanged
  + regular_executable is accepted unchanged
  + directory is rejected
  + Windows attributes remain separately derived seed facts and cannot determine the mode value
  - never: cite accepted mode as Git observation or reconciliation

& [OrdinalRelationModel] is declaration only
  + nonzero is the only single-entry structural constraint
  + monotonicity, uniqueness, contiguity, canonical order, and traversal ownership require a later inventory scope
  - never: infer collection relations from one scalar

& [OutputModel] is lineage preserving
  + [profile] is exact projection profile
  + [plan] is complete validated placement syntax
  + [content_binding] is complete consumed prerequisite output
  + [topology_observation] is complete validated M2A value
  + [surface] is private fields, Serialize, immutable getters, and no Deserialize, Default, public constructor, public field, or mutable getter
  - never: implement From or Into that returns a bare TopologyEntryObservation

& [FaultModel] is closed and bounded
  + [codes] are json, profile, projection_identity, entry_reference_identity, entry_reference, component, mode, ordinal, kind, topology_form, and resource
  + [nested_topology_fault] is present exactly for topology_form and absent otherwise
  + [field] is at most 64 Unicode scalar values
  + [message] is at most 256 Unicode scalar values
  + [atomicity] every failure returns no binding, plan, topology observation, wrapper, or resumable success state
  - never: include content chunks, hash state, complete encoded input, or serialized binding in diagnostics

